# Compiled binaries
scripts/optimizations/copy_to_hugetlbfs

# Model weights staged inside the worktree for agent-sandbox sessions. The
# sandbox mounts only the worktree, so a checkpoint has to live here to be
# reachable; multi-GB binaries must never reach a commit.
# Leading slash matters: a bare `models/` also matches training/models/, which is
# source.
/models/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
# The committed test fixtures are the deliberate exception: they are kilobytes,
# they are the golden inputs the runtime's tests load, and rust-harness/fixtures
# is where regenerating them writes. Without these negations `git add` would need
# -f every time the fixture is regenerated.
!rust-harness/fixtures/*.gguf

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
CLEANUP_PLAN.md

# Agent tooling state (token usage ledger written by usage.ts)
.agent-state/

# Lint cache
.ruff_cache/
.coverage

# Browser verification harness dependencies (scripts/verify/obs_browser)
node_modules/
package-lock.json
